title: The Health Compact
subtitle: Hospitals need money and authority, not another summit.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_government_card
view-if: left_in_government = 1 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and health_minister_party = "Lewica" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_health_compact_timer <= 0 and (health_capacity < 85 or pandemic_deaths_pressure > 0)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_health_compact_timer = 4
card-image: img/poland/cards/health-compact.webp

= Health

Waiting lists become the coalition's first delivery test. [? if
government_party = "pis": Morawiecki wants the queues shortened before PiS
loses credit for appointing a Lewica minister. The ministry wants staff before
it accepts responsibility for the promise.?]

[? if left_is_junior_partner = 1: **[+ coalition_senior_partner +] holds the
premiership**, and the health budget line with it. Objection risk on a
contested measure: **[+ coalition_objection_risk +]%**.?]

- @capacity
- @dental_paediatric
- @clinics
- @audit

@capacity
title: Finance staff and hospital capacity
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity.
choose-if: budget >= 2 and health_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Health Ministry and two budget points.
on-arrival: {!
const support =
    Number(Q.social_spending_support) * 0.65 +
    Number(Q.vaccination_support) * 0.35;
const salience =
    Number(Q.social_spending_salience) * 0.60 +
    Number(Q.vaccination_salience) * 0.40;
const backlash =
    Number(Q.social_spending_backlash) * 0.60 +
    Number(Q.vaccination_backlash) * 0.40;
const raw =
    (support - 50) / 15 + salience / 55 - backlash / 60;
const net = Math.round(Math.max(
    -3,
    Math.min(3, raw * (0.45 + salience / 100))
));
const scale = Math.max(0.70, Math.min(1.50, 1 + net * 0.15));
Q.budget -= 2;
Q.health_capacity += Math.max(4, Math.round(7 * scale));
Q.public_sector_support += Math.max(2, Math.round(4 * scale));
Q.government_delivery += Math.max(3, Math.round(5 * scale));
Q.public_trust += net * 0.45;
Q.left_poll += net * 0.08;
Q.social_spending_support += net >= 1 ? 1 : 0;
Q.social_spending_salience += 4;
Q.social_spending_backlash += net < 0 ? 3 : 1;
Q.vaccination_support += net >= 1 ? 1 : (net <= -2 ? -1 : 0);
Q.vaccination_salience += Q.year <= 2022 ? 4 : 1;
Q.vaccination_backlash += net < 0 ? 2 : 0;
Q.card_public_response_score = net;
Q.card_public_response = net >= 2
    ? "breakthrough"
    : (net >= 1
        ? "favourable"
        : (net <= -2
            ? "reversal"
            : (net <= -1 ? "backlash" : "contested")));
Q.public_opinion_last_issue =
    "Public health spending and vaccination";
Q.public_opinion_last_reception = Q.card_public_response;
Q.public_opinion_last_delta = net;
Q.public_opinion_last_action = "Health compact: staff and capacity";
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk);
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    // The Chancellery keeps the announcement and halves the establishment plan.
    Q.health_capacity = Math.round(Q.health_capacity - 3);
    Q.government_delivery -= 2;
    Q.public_sector_support -= 1;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 6;
    Q.coalition_blur += 3;
    Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
    Q.health_policy_pressure += 3;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Hospital staffing plan";
    Q.government_goal_health = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " halves the hospital staffing plan before it reaches the wards";
} else {
    Q.government_goal_health = 2;
    Q.health_policy_pressure = Math.max(0, Q.health_policy_pressure - 10);
    Q.news_headline = net >= 1
        ? "The health compact turns public demand into staff and beds"
        : (net <= -1
            ? "Health spending is lost in a renewed trust fight"
            : "The health compact finances staff and beds");
}
!}

[? if card_public_response = "breakthrough": Hospitals are a high-salience
need with a broad constituency. Visible staffing converts budget capacity into
both delivery and political ownership. ?]
[? if card_public_response = "favourable": The investment fits the public
mood. Arguments about cost and vaccination remain secondary to the demand for
a functioning service. ?]
[? if card_public_response = "contested": Beds are popular, but confidence in
the institutions delivering them is uneven. The compact earns credit without
ending the public-health argument. ?]
[? if card_public_response = "backlash": Pandemic polarisation contaminates
an otherwise popular capacity package. Delivery gains survive; political gains
shrink. ?]
[? if card_public_response = "reversal": Distrust is so intense that new
spending is read as another failed system defending itself. The ministry must
deliver before the polls recover. ?]

[? if last_card_objection = 1: The establishment plan comes back from the
Chancellery with the second and third year deleted and a note about the
medium-term financial framework. The wards that were promised staff read the
same press release we did.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@dental_paediatric
title: Put dentistry and children's care back inside the public network
subtitle: Cost: 2 budget capacity. The service PiS promised and never built, delivered where its voters live.
choose-if: budget >= 2 and health_minister_party = "Lewica"
unavailable-subtitle: Requires the Health Ministry and two budget points.
on-arrival: {!
Q.budget -= 2;
const objectionRoll = this.random.uint32() / 4294967296;
const objected =
    Q.left_is_junior_partner &&
    objectionRoll * 100 < Number(Q.coalition_objection_risk) * 0.9;
Q.last_card_objection = objected ? 1 : 0;
Q.last_card_objector = Q.coalition_senior_partner;
if (objected) {
    Q.health_capacity += 2;
    Q.government_delivery += 1;
    Q.left_coalition_dissent += 5;
    Q.coalition_blur += 2;
    Q.ministry_overruled_count += 1;
    Q.ministry_overruled_last = "Public dentistry and paediatric care";
    Q.government_goal_health = 1;
    Q.news_headline =
        Q.coalition_senior_partner +
        " reduces the public dentistry programme to a school pilot";
} else {
    Q.health_capacity += 5;
    Q.household_security += 3;
    Q.government_delivery += 4;
    Q.pensioner_support += 3;
    Q.women_support += 3;
    Q.provincial_welfare_left_affinity += 4;
    Q.older_welfare_households_left_affinity += 4;
    Q.rural_localists_left_affinity += 2;
    Q.pis_poll_momentum -= 0.25;
    Q.konf_poll_momentum -= 0.1;
    Q.social_spending_salience += 3;
    Q.government_goal_health = 2;
    Q.health_policy_pressure = Math.max(0, Q.health_policy_pressure - 8);
    if (Q.government_party == "pis") {
        Q.government_coalition_dissent += 4;
        Q.pis_relation -= 3;
    } else {
        Q.ko_coalition_dissent += 3;
        Q.psl_coalition_dissent -= 2;
    }
    Q.news_headline =
        "Public dentistry and children's care return to the small-town network";
}
!}

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

[? if last_card_objection = 0: Dentistry is the service Polish households pay
for privately or go without, and children's specialists are the appointment that
does not exist within a hundred kilometres of most of the country. Both go back
into the public network with contracts attached, in the counties where PiS wins
by explaining that nobody in Warsaw builds anything for them.?][? if
last_card_objection = 1: What survives is a school screening pilot in four
voivodeships and a commitment to evaluate it. The dentists' chairs remain
private, and so does the bill.?]

[? if last_card_objection = 0: The programme's political value is that it is
impossible to describe as metropolitan. It is a dentist, in a town, paid for by
the state.?]

- #poland_card_finish

@clinics
title: Protect rural clinics first
subtitle: Cost: 1 budget capacity.
choose-if: budget >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one budget point.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; health_capacity += 4; rural_support += 3; psl_coalition_dissent -= 3 if government_party != "pis"; pis_relation += 2 if government_party = "pis"; government_coalition_dissent -= 2 if government_party = "pis"; government_delivery += 3; government_goal_health = 1; news_headline = "Rural clinics lead the health compact"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

- #poland_card_finish


@audit
title: Audit waiting lists and procurement
subtitle: Free fallback. Useful, publishable, and not treatment; the queue is now documented in our name.
on-arrival: health_capacity += 1; public_trust += 2; government_delivery += 1; media_capacity += 1; health_policy_pressure += 3; labor_dissent += 2; public_sector_support -= 1; last_card_objection = 0; news_headline = "The ministry publishes the waiting-list audit"

**Result:** [+ news_headline +].

The audit is real work and costs nothing: median waits by procedure, by
voivodeship, with the procurement failures named.

It also puts our signature on a number nobody has funded. The next time the
queue is quoted in the Sejm, it will be quoted from our document, and the
demand it documents goes up rather than down.

- #poland_card_finish
